# Gameplay. Left along the bottom of the pool enclosure, then straight up its
# left side: object 6 is at (251,302) and this crosses it around frame 2000.
1860   Left
1910   Up
# Up and right into the north-west yard, until the bench below object 0 stops
# him.
2070   Up+Right
2100   Up
# Round the right end of the bench, up over it, back left, and down onto the
# item. The ammo counter reads 249 from here on.
2170   Right
2200   Up
2225   Left
2252   Down
2282   -
